  jurisdiction.
  https://github.com/ecmwf/thermofeel

thermofeel's Liljegren module transcribes Liljegren et al. (2008), "Modeling the wet bulb
globe temperature using standard meteorological measurements", J. Occup. Environ. Hyg. 5(10),
https://doi.org/10.1080/15459620802310770, and Kong & Huber (2022).

Weather data: Open-Meteo Historical Weather API (https://open-meteo.com/), based on ERA5
reanalysis; Open-Meteo data are offered under CC BY 4.0.
